1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
A city park changes with every season.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,520
In spring, cherry trees bloom
along the walking paths.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,360
Children run across the green grass while
their parents sit on wooden benches.

4
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:13,760
In summer, families spread picnic blankets
in the shade of tall trees, ducks swim

5
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,220
slowly across the pond.

6
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:18,690
In autumn the leaves turn orange
and red and fall onto the paths.

7
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:22,140
In winter the park is quiet,
covered in a thin layer of frost.

8
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:25,540
Every season the park gives
the city a place to breathe.
